-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §54 ההמרה: non-academics moving to the reform
-- under §51(א)(1) and (ב) are converted by the existing academic teacher's
-- rules (§§44–50), with §55's change.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-common`
§ `54 ההמרה`

@ref akn:art_54
GIVEN `signed under 51(א)(1)` IS A BOOLEAN, `28 years or more under 51(ב)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `converted by the academic teachers' rules` `signed under 51(א)(1)` `28 years or more under 51(ב)` IF
    `signed under 51(א)(1)` OR `28 years or more under 51(ב)`

#ASSERT `converted by the academic teachers' rules` FALSE TRUE
